            "review_title": "Review at Mi Quang Ech",
            "review_text": "Daty L\n74 contributions\n0\nAverage food with nice decoration\nNov 2019\nWe have a late lunch before heading up to airport, just wanna try the famous Mi Quang Ech (Mi Quang cooked with frog) of Da Nang and also the location is nearby our hotel for our convenience.\n\nFood is average! We ordered 2 bowls of Mi Quang Ech and 1 bowl of Mi Quang mixed with all kind of meats. The portion is quite big, we are 4 pax were full after the meal. Taste is good but not special, the service is OK and not so friendly staff.\n\nThe total bill is around VND 320,000 which is fine.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 16, 2019",
