            "review_title": "Review at Mi Quang Ech",
            "review_text": "Phoenix Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam66 contributions\n1\nTerrible service\nNov 2018 • Friends\nWe reach Da Nang at late night so we just wanna eat little and something light. The front desk staff told us that Bep Trang was such a well known restaurant in Da Nang so we decided to get there for dinner. After checking the menu, we ordered a combo 5 kinds noodles (5 kinds of Mỳ Quảng) as the attached pics & 2 cups of aloe vera. We though that were enough for the little eaters like us. Although server tried to convince us to order 1 more dish - bánh tráng cuốn thịt heo, we did not order yet. We would order more if we finish that noodles combo. Then the server attitude turned to be so bad. He did not take a good care of us at all. I bet he would do the same with other people who order little food. \nIn terms of food taste, it's so so.\nRestaurant was nicely decor with hanging lanterns. But we came here for food not for watching lanterns. Both of us did not finish the 5th bowl of my quang. 4 bowls were full already. I called the previous server for checking bill. He even did not answer, just asked another staff to give me the receipt. I felt so disappointed because I never seen a bad attitude like that in the beautiful Da Nang. We definitely won't come back Bep Trang restaurants again.\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
